Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Go modules in this repository (`dashboard/`, `pustaka/`) depend on the Go
standard library only and vendor no third-party Go code — neither has a
`go.sum`. See `README.md`.

The documentation site vendors self-hosted web fonts and one JavaScript library,
each under its own licence, in `pustaka/docs/assets/`:

  * Atkinson Hyperlegible ....... SIL Open Font License 1.1
  * Bricolage Grotesque ......... SIL Open Font License 1.1
  * JetBrains Mono .............. SIL Open Font License 1.1
  * Apache ECharts .............. Apache License 2.0

Those licences are stated here from the upstream projects' own terms. The full
licence texts are not yet vendored alongside the asset files, which they should
be before a public release — retaining them is an obligation of redistribution,
not a courtesy.

Nothing in this repository transmits data to a third party at build or render
time. Where GAOS sends data anywhere at run time — to a model provider, on the
operator's own account — is documented in `pustaka/docs/product/brd.html`,
domain L.
